---
interface Props { compact?: boolean; }
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
const articleUrl = 'https://bottegadielena.it/blog/blu-61-formaggio-carpenedo-firenze/';
---
<article class:list={['blu61-card', { 'blu61-card-compact': compact }]} data-blu61-card>
  <a class="blu61-photo" href={articleUrl} aria-label="Scopri la storia del Blu ’61 Carpenedo">
    <img src="/images/blu61/blu61-carpenedo-principale-480.webp" srcset="/images/blu61/blu61-carpenedo-principale-480.webp 480w, /images/blu61/blu61-carpenedo-principale-800.webp 800w" sizes="(min-width: 760px) 340px, calc(100vw - 4.5rem)" width="800" height="535" alt="Blu ’61 Carpenedo: forma aperta con cranberries e confezione originale" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </a>
  <div class="blu61-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Salumi e formaggi · Carpenedo</p>
    <h2>Blu ’61, una storia d’amore</h2>
    <p>Raboso Passito, cranberries e una dedica per le nozze d’oro: scopri il formaggio erborinato della Casearia Carpenedo e la storia di Antonio e Giuseppina.</p>
    <a class="button" href={articleUrl}>Scopri la sua storia <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  .blu61-card{display:grid;gap:1.5rem;align-items:center;padding:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2rem);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--cream)}
  .blu61-photo{display:block;overflow:hidden;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) - .4rem);outline-offset:5px}
  .blu61-photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:800/535;object-fit:cover}
  .blu61-copy{min-width:0}.blu61-copy .eyebrow{margin-bottom:.75rem}.blu61-copy h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem);line-height:1.12;margin-bottom:1rem}.blu61-copy p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:40rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem}.blu61-copy .button{gap:.75rem}
  @media(min-width:760px){.blu61-card{grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,.75fr) 1.4fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3rem)}.blu61-card-compact{grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem}.blu61-card-compact h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,2.7vw,2.35rem)}}
</style>
